cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DFT-ML Pipeline for Ti-Al Alloys"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "neweracy"
repository-code: "https://github.com/neweracy/CASTEP-ML-PIPELINE"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline that extracts formation energies from CASTEP
  density functional theory (DFT) output files for the Ti-Al binary alloy
  system and trains a Gaussian Process Regression surrogate model to predict
  formation energies across the full composition range with calibrated
  uncertainty estimates.
keywords:
  - density functional theory
  - CASTEP
  - materials science
  - machine learning
  - Gaussian process regression
  - formation energy
  - titanium aluminide
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-16"
